Z||000013||Haze_Performance||03-03-2001||01:51 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by stimpy:<BR><B>This coming from a guy with a vinyl roof on his Fiero. <P>Huggybear from Starsky and Hutch called. He wants his Fiero back.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>LMAO!!! My side hurts!!<P>I for one dont think the New (99/01) Mustangs look too bad. They still need about 75 more H.P.  And a Fully loaded GT Hardtop should cost $22,000 NO MORE!!<P>Not to get on a rice topic...but The new Focus SVT is coming out in June.. 170 H.P. That little thing should scoot.. Saleen & Steeda already have an aftermarket for it. Hmmmm a 200+ H.P. Focus isnt looking too bad too me...<P>P.S. Racer 1.... Your car is fine.. Everyone has there own 2 cents...We are all just goofin... I for one dont like large wings but those Pisa taillights look cool..I might put a set on the 87.<P><BR>-----------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ttttttt.gif">   </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>PFF Members Photo Page</A><BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1431213" TARGET=_blank><BR>Photopoint Gallery (Updated Weekly)</A><p>[This message has been edited by Haze_Performance (edited 03-03-2001).]||||reg||11
