Z||000015||stimpy||03-03-2001||08:45 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroLisa:<BR><B>am i missing something here or what? granted, i don't care for that top, but whats with the flames? i'm just wondering if something happened that i didnt know about with this guy...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>No flames, Lisa, I just like calling 'em as I see 'em'. And I see that it's pretty damn ridiculous that Racer1 sees himself as some kind of indicator of good taste in automotive design. Not to mention, I, like many others, are sick to death of the pejoritive word "riceboy". It does not define anything due to it's blanket overuse. <P>Now pimpmobile, THAT still means something! Phat whip, Racer1, when do you get the sidepipes and continental kit? ||||reg||10
Z||000016||danny boy||03-04-2001||04:15 AM|||| Some people on this forum, no, most people on this forum, use the term because they need to feel better than someone else. Personally, I think half the guys are just jealous that there are some nice Imports out there that turn way more heads than their Fiero ever will. These small minded a..holes need to grow the f..k up.YOU DRIVE A FIERO.IT IS NOT A FERRARI. IT MAY BE FUN TO DRIVE,BUT     nevermind.This subject just pisses me off so much. Comments like" I wouldn't put that on my car because it looks like something that might be on an import" or "that wing looks ricey" just show ignorance and small mindedness.<P>             GROW UP||||reg||1
Z||000017||Sleeper||03-04-2001||12:18 PM||||    <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by danny boy:<BR><B> Some people on this forum, no, most people on this forum, use the term because they need to feel better than someone else. Personally, I think half the guys are just jealous that there are some nice Imports out there that turn way more heads than their Fiero ever will. These small minded a..holes need to grow the f..k up.YOU DRIVE A FIERO.IT IS NOT A FERRARI. IT MAY BE FUN TO DRIVE,BUT     nevermind.This subject just pisses me off so much. Comments like" I wouldn't put that on my car because it looks like something that might be on an import" or "that wing looks ricey" just show ignorance and small mindedness.<P>             GROW UP</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>yo man i kinda feel the same way. i really don't care if i make my car look ricey or importish, its cool cuz its what i want, to make my fiero be differant than all the rest<P>  <IMG SRC="http://store3.yimg.com/I/jspec_1625_13878843">    i wouldn't mind putting on this Tanabe Racing Medalion muffler on my fiero i just gotta have a custom bent piping.<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Whatever Floats Your Boat<HR></BLOCKQUOTE> just do it.<P>back to the main point of this topic...the new Ford 49's look sweet i think they are still in concept stage i saw one here at the big international auto show a month or 2 ago old/new look, rolling on 20's.<P><p>[This message has been edited by Sleeper (edited 03-04-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000018||Songman||03-04-2001||01:28 PM||||I have never used the word ricer on this forum but let me say this...<P>I have had some great import cars. Porsche, Jaguar, I even owned a Fiat. Hell, I drive a Lexus now. As far as I know that was not built in the U.S.<P>And from my previous posts on subjects like seatbelts an stuff, everyone knows that I think everyone is entitled to their own opinions. And no one should get pissed off about anything that is said. This is supposed to be fun.<P>Now, I haven't seen the car in question so I can't comment on that. But I will tell you some things that I think, in my own opinion, look stupid on cars... Huge words on the side of cars. Tall wings on 4 door sedans. 18" or more wheels with .5" of sidewall and same cars listed above. Wheel/tire combos that are way too wide and way to short for any car. And above all, the one thing I hate on any car which is really more the driver than the car... I hate any driver that feels like I need to hear his stupid bass thumping music in my car a half block away, or even worse, in my house as they drive by... it is not only stupid and illegal, it is dangerous. But I do like the way most of the people that do that wear their hat backwards! heheh... Not really, but I always like to end on a positive note.<P><BR>There is my opinion. And I have a right to it. No one should be pissed off. But you do have a right to feel differently and even voice that opinion without having to call me names or insult my mother. Everybody have fun!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||7
