Z||000020||gabriel||03-04-2001||02:04 PM||||Man, some of you guys are brutal!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  remind me not to get on your wrong side ...<P>BTW; what does this mean?<BR>     &gt;? It looks like it has been parked in my neighborhood for awhile,and it really just arrived at the dealer.<P>           ???||||reg||1
Z||000021||Formula||03-04-2001||04:07 PM||||I think that you should do whatever you like to your car, I personally dont like really loud bass but I do like deep bass, thats why I have a 10" sub in my fiero, I like tall wings on sporty cars, but if someone likes them on 4 doors cars, Im not going to tell them its ugly becuase thats ignorant.  if you like vinyl tops on cars then thats your opinion, I've never seen a pic of the car or seen it in person so I dont have an opinion.  my goal for my fiero is to make it look less like a fiero, why, I dont know, probably because I want people to think its a really fast car.  I do like fieros, they are cheap, easy to work on, fun to drive, but a new economy car aka civic will blow the doors off a fiero gt with some small mods.  <P>A matter of fact, I think I might have found someone to put 300zx lights or miata flush lights on my fiero, why am I doing this? because its what I like.  and I personally dont take rice as an offensive term, I know of some FAST imporst that have stickers all over them, and I know of some HELLA FAST cars that I wouldnt even know they were turbos until they go 0-60 in 4 secs.<P>thats all for now, no flames intended.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/yellowtored3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000022||firstfiero||03-04-2001||04:26 PM||||      Do what ever the hell you like but the fact remains if you put a big 3 tiered rear spoiler on your 4 banger with a bunch of stickers and think that now your much faster.....I and most people that know better are gonna laugh at ya!!! If your going for that look and don't care about performance and speed thats fine. I think it look stupid as hell and that's why I'm not going to do it to my car. Some people look at a fiero...like me...and think it looks perfect the way it is! some people look at it and think gee I wonder what it would look like if huggybear was driving it.... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> That joke had me rolling...do what you like! As long as you don't think stickers = HP its cool!   ||||reg||7
